    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0704" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg580"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.00/855</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Department of State to
                        the Portuguese Legation</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>In replying to the Portuguese Chargé d’Affaires’ Memorandum of October 22,<anchor
                        n="4a" xml:id="d516-f1"/> requesting information concerning the attitude of
                    the Government of the United States toward the proposed plenary conference to
                    discuss the future status of Tangier, the Department of State wishes to inform
                    him that it has taken occasion recently to remind the Governments participating
                    in the conference that while <pb facs="0705" n="581" xml:id="pg581"/> it has no
                    political interest in Morocco it is fundamentally interested in maintaining the
                    principle of the Open Door in Tangier, that is as stated in its ratification of
                    the Act of Algeciras in securing equality of commercial opportunity and adequate
                    protection for the life, liberty and property of its citizens.</p>
                <p>This Government, of course, presumes that nothing will be done at the forthcoming
                    conference to interfere with the principle above mentioned or with the rights
                    and interests of the United States.<anchor n="5" xml:id="d516-f2"/></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1923-10-23"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 23, 1923</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d516-f1" n="4a" xml:id="d516-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d516-f2" n="5" xml:id="d516-f2-content">
                <p>In reply to a verbal inquiry by the Italian Ambassador, a memorandum in the same
                    terms was sent him on Oct. 24.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
